# summary: the worked example notes module: put, show, and keys over the module store
# version: 0.1.0
# description:
# The notes module is the worked example of the module authoring guide. It is a
# feature module: a package part the engine discovers and dispatches.
#
# The module owns three verbs and one store declaration. Its verbs source the
# storage core's library and call the store, so the module never names the
# configured driver. Its data file declares only the namespace and the key
# pattern; the root, the suffix, and the change-log flag take the core defaults.
